  "prediction": "The microphone data was discussed in the context of downsampling, with some participants suggesting that it might be beneficial to not downsample the data to 16 kHz, but rather to keep the original 48 kHz sampling rate. It was also mentioned that the microphone data is being recorded at 48 kHz and then downsampled to 16 kHz, and that this process might be affecting the quality of the data. Additionally, the possibility of using a different type of microphone, such as a hand-held wireless microphone, was discussed as a potential solution to the limitations of the current microphone setup.",
